    "name": "Chetta: The Machinery Girl",
    "steam_appid": 3427220,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/1d4e11c4bc729ad3e4689593d74ab7f9.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/9661589dc81f560ca929af260ff92f8e.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/9661589dc81f560ca929af260ff92f8e.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/9661589dc81f560ca929af260ff92f8e.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chetta, an amnesiac girl, awakens and is forced to pilot a giant robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursued as a rebel for reasons she doesn't comprehend, Chetta crash-lands on an undeveloped island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is filled with dangerous creatures, hostile natives, and her pursuers, all of whom are coming after her, in more ways than one\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and conspiracies lie hidden on the island, as if they were waiting for her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Chetta escape the island unharmed? Her fate is left to the player\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/f52af42290be03183792837a2b825b31.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/149cc6f60d11bc3025d2484bca000ff8.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chetta (VA: Fuyusa Nagi)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character. She was seemingly famed for being a girl genius, but she's currently lost her memory. She was pursued for being a rebel and crash-landed on an undeveloped island. She's cheerful, positive, and not one to let hardship get her down, but it's unclear if this was always her personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lina (Ryoko Tezuka)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The captain of the squadron pursuing Chetta. Her impulsivity sometimes creates trouble for the people around her. She seems to have had a deep relationship with Chetta in the past, but Chetta doesn't remember it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rabbit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The support AI for the MK-L that Chetta pilots. It teaches the amnesiac Chetta various things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/f7f60f005942af1182c91015da91003b.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/faa91e64c9e32d8be9530adac6bfa9a2.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/faa91e64c9e32d8be9530adac6bfa9a2.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/faa91e64c9e32d8be9530adac6bfa9a2.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/253e9e7226813613b509ac6d4c841bc4.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/253e9e7226813613b509ac6d4c841bc4.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/253e9e7226813613b509ac6d4c841bc4.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of horny enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's out to get Chetta! Either skillfully defeat your opponents in battle, or risk letting them have their way with her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous graphics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-quality animations that mix 3D CG and LIVE 2D graphics! All parts of Chetta's body move, giggle, and bounce! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up through exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skill points to get stronger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new recipes for crafting battle items as you win fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll come up with stronger items as you refine your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gears attached to your weapons will improve at random!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your favorite weapons until you master them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRPG-style battles in a robot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use accumulated energy to upgrade your mech and take down the enemy forces pursuing Chetta!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty adjustments that allow you to turn various elements on and off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play casually and focus on the story, or you can turn up the difficulty to enjoy challenging exploration and combat! It's all up to you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/5b5b1cc970d490346a3240135688204f.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/6e60eb374cb1ea475c894de207733bc0.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/6e60eb374cb1ea475c894de207733bc0.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/6e60eb374cb1ea475c894de207733bc0.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca0\ud83d\udca0 Please read carefully before purchase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed using a tool called RPGDeveloperBakin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minimum PC specs of this game are assumed to be the same as those required to run RPGDeveloperBakin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We recommend playing the trial to check how well the game runs on your PC before purchasing the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*AMD CPUs (Ryzen) and GPUs (Radeon) may result in errors such as the graphics in animated segments being displayed incorrectly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
