g_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/5b5b1cc970d490346a3240135688204f.avif?t=1753666371\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/064907379e03b342c9f76e30fa2f9a29.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/266ede91ef633421e20d5cce5933145c.mp4?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/6e60eb374cb1ea475c894de207733bc0.poster.avif?t=1753666371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427220/extras/6e60eb374cb1ea475c894de207733bc0.webm?t=1753666371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.aka